<title>FRANCE: France's Canalsatellite to carry Euronews.</title>
<headline>France's Canalsatellite to carry Euronews.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Euronews news and information network will be carried on the Canalsatellite digital television system, Canalsatellite and Euronews said this week in a joint statement.</p>
<p>Canalsatellite, launched in 1996, is owned by French media group Canal Plus.</p>
<p>Euronews, which was launched in 1993, groups 18 European public service broadcasters as well as news agencies.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
